OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI at 25: How representative is
OL,4,Athe force?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Chief Constable Bobby Singleton
OL,7,Fwas at a book launch in Belfast
OL,8,Frecently when he was asked: "Which Blue
OL,9,FLights character would you like on your
OL,10,Fteam?"
OL,12,FFor those who don't know, Blue Lights
OL,13,Fis an acclaimed BBC drama about
OL,14,Fofficers in the Police Service of
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI).
OL,17,FHis answer was quite revealing: "Annie
OL,18,Fand Grace because we need to be more
OL,19,Frepresentative of the Catholic
OL,20,Fcommunity and we need more women."
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
